    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d792">

                <pb facs="0825" n="775" xml:id="pg775"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Riddle to Mr.
                            Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Pera</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1894-04-20"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">April 20,
                    1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Adam Aivazian, subject of your despatch No. 162, is the bearer of passport No.
                    14470, signed by Secretary of State Blaine, May 2, 1890. Is it genuine and shall
                    I demand his release?</p>
            </div>
        </body>
